{
 "format": "executor-vector/v1",
 "id": "live-answers",
 "description": "A live pin gives one entry for each answer of the engine, also for a failed answer such as needs_input. The cursor comes from the host. Key order and white space in the inputs do not change inputs_ref. A string with escapes and non-ASCII text has the lifecycle record bytes.",
